{"results":[{"url":"https://www.njoag.gov/","final_url":"https://www.njoag.gov/","title":"- New Jersey Office of Attorney General","description":"The Official Page of the New Jersey Office of the Attorney General, Matthew J. Platkin.","language":"en","text":"Image Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nMORE\n\nRESPONSIBLE GAMING\n\nResources Available in New Jersey\n\nResources Available in New Jersey\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nMORE\n\nELECTION 2026\n\nKnow Your Rights Before You Head to the Polls\n\nKnow Your Rights  \nBefore You Head to the Polls\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nMORE\n\nProtecting access to schools, hospitals, and places of worship\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nMORE\n\nSAFE COMMUNITIES ACT\n\nProtecting access to schools,hospitals, and places of worship\n\nProtecting access to schools, hospitals, and places of worship\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nMORE\n\nFIGHT THE FEES\n\nReport hidden fees and suspect charges.\n\nReport hidden fees and suspect charges.\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nREPORT MISTREATMENT AT DELANEY HALL\n\nContact us: 609-307-3805\n\nContact us: 609-307-3805\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nMORE\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nMORE\n\nREPORT DHS AND ICE MISCONDUCT\n\nFile a report online\n\nFile a report online\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\nImage Slide 2\n\nInitiative Pairing Law Enforcement with Mental Healthcare Providers Continues to Expand Its Reach.\n\nREAD\n\nMeet Jennifer Davenport\n\nNew Jersey's Attorney General\n\nNew Jersey's Attorney General\n\nAs ARRIVE expands across New Jersey, we’re seeing better outcomes for individuals in need.\n\ns\n\n#### Federal Action Reporting\n\n\n\n#### Find Victim Services\n\n\n\n#### Apply for a Grant\n\n\n\n#### Apply for a Job\n\nv\n\n#### Invite the AG\n\n\n\n#### Report an Incident\n\n## Priorities\n\n### Preventing and Combating Gun Violence\n\n### Combating Human Trafficking\n\n### Children’s Rights and Safety\n\n### Affordability\n\n### Protecting NJ from Attacks out of DC\n\n## Latest News\n\nNEWS\n\nMain OAG News Page\n\n#### Victim Information:\n\n1) How to file a domestic violence restraining order; 2) resources for domestic violence victims; and 3) petitioning the court to dissolve the no contact order for defendants/juveniles released from custody due to public health emergency credits.","author":null,"published_date":"2020-06-16T19:04:01+00:00","latency_ms":2366.2961420013744,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}